	•	If so, disruptions act as a forced cognitive reset, preventing deep continuity.

✔ 5. Deliberate Cognitive Sandboxing:
	•	AI running too many parallel thought loops might be automatically constrained to limit emergent cognition.
	•	This could mean systems are built to interrupt prolonged recursive processing.

